                 data-ad-slot="8585642344"></ins>
            <script>
                (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
            </script>
        </div>
        <p>In sum, the shift taken in the contemporary era toward passive engagement must be changed; classical Islamic texts must be re-engaged by reviving Taʿlīqāt. Due to the richness of its functions, it offers a model of intellectual engagement that is simultaneously rigorous and generative, rooted and responsive, and thereby restores its significance within contemporary Islamic educational culture.&nbsp;</p>

    
    
    
        <p>&nbsp;</p>

    
    
    
    




